  "description": "This skill should be used when the user wants to analyze a Git repository and profile each developer's commit habits, work habits, development efficiency, code style, code quality, and engagement index — all without installing any extra packages or running any custom scripts. It relies purely on native git CLI commands (and standard Unix text-processing utilities already present on the host) and AI-driven interpretation. Trigger phrases include \"analyze repository\" \"profile developers\" \"commit habits\" \"developer report card\" \"代码分析\" \"研发效率\" \"开发者画像\" \"提交习惯\" \"工作习惯\" \"参与度\".",
